Output rename.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 18
Set Width 1100
Set Height 560
Set Padding 20
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 45ms

Hide
Type `export PS1='$ ' && eval "$(csw hook bash)" && clear` Enter
Show

Type "csw list" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "csw rename personal home" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "csw list" Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "csw use home" Enter
Sleep 1500ms
Type "claude" Enter
Sleep 3s
